     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 2. LWR density evolution on a 10 km corridor with \
an initial density block. Left: space-time heatmap; the bright diagonal \
streak is the backward-propagating shock. Right: snapshots at five increasing \
times showing the jam block dissolve into a backward shock (left edge) and a \
forward rarefaction (right edge).\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontFamily->"Helvetica",
