    {
     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 6. 50 IDM vehicles on a 1 km ring road. Left: \
space-time trajectories; each diagonal line is one vehicle's position over \
time, coloured by its speed. The red (stopped) diagonal bands are the phantom \
jam, rotating backward relative to the vehicle motion. Right: speed time \
series of four sample vehicles showing the oscillation passing through them \
in turn.\"\>",
       StripOnInput->False,
       FontFamily->"Helvetica",
       FontSize->10,
       FontSlant->Italic],
      Alignment->Center,
      ImageSize->680]}
