     PaneBox[
      StyleBox["\<\"Figure 8. Bando OVM on an 800 m ring road with 40 \
vehicles, seeded by a 5 m position perturbation on one vehicle. Left: \
space-time trajectories. Right: mean speed and its standard deviation over \
time. Mean speed crashes from ~13 m/s at t=0 to under 1 m/s as the \
instability saturates.\"\>",
