Cell["\<\
Extending to two lanes with a symmetric lane-change rule (incentive: would \
have to brake in current lane; safety: sufficient gap ahead and behind in the \
target lane; target cell free) recovers the classic multi-lane redistribution.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"5894a911-ce1a-4bda-98a5-3e3be9fa20a8"],

